          "rationale": "Classification of revised source content; no teaching-content edits.",
          "sourcePages": [
            51
          ],
          "sourceTargetId": "page-51-q1-b"
        },
        "answer": {
          "short": "$13$",
          "worked": "Substitute $y = 27$ into $y = 2x + 1$:\n$$27 = 2x + 1$$\n$$26 = 2x$$\n$$x = 13$$\nWe can make $13$ triangles with $27$ matches.",
